otsJ5qYQ7kNvwFP9jAu&_nc_oc=Adq5Vk9e2ehoa1h4-E_cgaNm2UQw8_sLeaDqWGkKKahtEQa3clfDI25k8_UjKZ5QuMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIPUn6fv1BI-v8CnoKORvyKFf8zlPibTLbxuWsSO5Qcyg&oe=6AB154D4"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "649512930873901", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618484_649512934207234_7095113286224355206_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_o5it4lkFRcQ7kNvwGX5Wtf&_nc_oc=AdraDUP0dUHsSQ15-nzV8ZbsSXm4JwLOx1JkO9sxPLml28D5EsxUTDQolvLgFxqKaNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJX5JLR6_sdazoC-IpzQRVtJkpvGeQgoHeiAb4e0VnJQw&oe=6AB15324"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1467992020894328", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619742_1467992024227661_8934197663888657607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PD9tmWanYkQQ7kNvwHhiBOJ&_nc_oc=AdogsXFSAAywlfekboIMZLc63BeZHWDCuZQIuLDT5uYWCIY_WHYhu2XF1wz15VLeUpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLKP2YxVG7BGB65kQECysjZBilCtwn6b7Cs_T8UoAIKJQ&oe=6AB13040"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bending Champions", "keywords": ["avatar", "element", "fight", "free", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Choose an element, battle others, become a bending champion.\nIn Bending Champions you must strike martial art poses to bend the elements. A magic system that is both rewarding and difficult to master. Fight other players to earn currency to spend on unlocking cosmetics and customizing your avatar.\n\n# Fight others\n- **1v1 duels** for pure skill\n- **2v2 and 3v3 team fights** for the power of friendship\n- **1v1v1v1** for an all out brawl\n# Choose your playstyle\n- **Earth:** Defensive and slower, but hard hitting\n- **Water:** Rapid fire and buildup\n- **Fire:** High damage and targeting\n- **Air:** Low damage but high mobility and knockback", "short_description": "A VR multiplayer arena fighter where you master elementa